<title>INDIA: India DCM Daewoo 1st half 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India DCM Daewoo 1st half 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   281.50 vs   175.00</p>
<p>    Net sales	  4,281.00 vs 1,002.60</p>
<p>    Other income	 114.60 vs   144.00</p>
<p>    Expenditure	3,999.50 vs   889.40</p>
<p>    Interest		43.60 vs    50.70</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 352.50 vs   206.50</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  71.00 vs    31.50</p>
<p>    Tax			Nil  vs     Nil</p>
<p>Note: DCM Daewoo Motors is a joint venture between India's DCM Limited and South Korea's Daewoo Corp. It manufactures the Cielo car in India.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom (91-11-301 2024)</p>
</text>
